# Install

Install commands are published in the repository
[README](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/README.md). Do not treat
this page as a second source of truth.

## macOS app and Homebrew cask

The signed `OKMate.app` zip is on
[GitHub Releases](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/releases/latest). The
Homebrew cask and the fully qualified `brew install --cask` line live under
[Install OKMate.app (macOS)](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/README.md#install-okmateapp-macos).

## CLI from this repository

Maintainer and contributor installs stay in
[Development](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/README.md#development)
(`uv run --no-dev okmate-ops install cli`, or `cargo run --no-default-features`).
A `cargo install` or copied `okmate` binary on `PATH` does not self-update.

## After install

```sh
okmate check knowledge --profile strict --format terminal
```

`check`, `inspect`, `search`, and `build` take one root. If you have several
configured trees, list them first: [Multiple bundles](/docs/multiple-bundles/).
